 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Add a `--default` option to `dotenv get`: it is printed (exit code 0) if the key is missing or has no value. Empty string values still count as set.
+
 ### Fixed
 
 - Fix a package build deprecation warning caused by a non-string `license` value in `pyproject.toml` by [@kurtmckee] in [#648]
